Individual Project, DSCI 100 (80 points)

Instructions
This is an individual assignment. 

This project will be self-contained in a Jupyter Notebook, which you will fill out. When prompted, fill out the cells with your code (in code cells) or text (in text cells) to answer the question. The cells will have "%%% EDIT THIS MARKDOWN CELL %%%" or "### EDIT THIS CODE CELL ###" prompting you to overwrite the contents of the cell with your answer.

Your report must be fully reproducible, and run without error by itself with no other files. 
